    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"The day I had to accept my admission offer from AKU for a Master of Science in Nursing, I was at the hospital with my pre-term baby in the NICU. I look at the email on my phone screen. I got into AKU? I couldn't believe my eyes. It was a dream come true. But I look up and see my firstborn inside the incubator fighting for his life.",
